+	* doc/gperf.texi (User-supplied Struct): Mention the possibility of an
+	abbreviated struct declaration.
+	* src/input.cc (Input::read_input): Support struct declarations of the
+	form "struct foo;".
+	* tests/incomplete.gperf: New file.
